ect clinically  relevant  variants so with that  i will end this presentation again i  would very much like to thank the  the organizers for inviting me  and uh this is the first time i've  actually put on a long sleeve shirt and  a bow  tie since march i thank everybody for  allowing me to have that opportunity  and i hope you appreciated the talk so  thank you very much


